<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Confirmación de Compra - {{eventName}}</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&family=Unbounded:wght@400;900&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@300;700&family=Crimson+Pro:ital,wght@1,900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            border-radius: 0 !important;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #fff;
            background-color: #000;
            background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');
            background-repeat: repeat;
        }
        
        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .header h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: 300;
        }
        
        .header .emoji {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: block;
        }
        
        .content {
            padding: 30px 20px;
        }
        
        .greeting {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #2c3e50;
        }
        
        .success-message {
            background-color: #d4edda;
            border: 1px solid #c3e6cb;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .success-message .icon {
            font-size: 32px;
            color: #28a745;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            display: block;
        }
        
        .success-message h2 {
            color: #155724;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 22px;
        }
        
        .success-message p {
            color: #155724;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        
        .event-info {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
        }
        
        .event-info h3 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .event-info h3 .icon {
            margin-right: 10px;
            font-size: 28px;
        }
        
        .event-details {
            display: grid;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        
        .event-detail {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        
        .event-detail .icon {
            width: 24px;
            margin-right: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #667eea;
        }
        
        .event-detail strong {
            color: #2c3e50;
        }
        
        .tickets-section {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        
        .tickets-section h3 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .tickets-section h3 .icon {
            margin-right: 10px;
            color: #667eea;
        }
        
        .ticket-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8f9fa 0%, #e9ecef 100%);
            border: 2px solid #dee2e6;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .ticket-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 4px;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
        }
        
        .ticket-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        
        .ticket-code {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        }
        
        .ticket-type {
            background-color: #667eea;
            color: white;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        
        .ticket-details {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 10px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        
        .ticket-detail {
            color: #6c757d;
        }
        
        .ticket-detail strong {
            color: #2c3e50;
        }
        
        .qr-section {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding-top: 15px;
            border-top: 1px dashed #dee2e6;
        }
        
        .qr-code {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 120px;
            height: 120px;
            background-color: white;
            border: 2px solid #dee2e6;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .qr-placeholder {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            color: #6c757d;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .qr-instructions {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #6c757d;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }
        
        .summary {
            background-color: #e3f2fd;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        
        .summary h3 {
            color: #1565c0;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        
        .summary-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        
        .summary-row.total {
            border-top: 2px solid #1565c0;
            padding-top: 10px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #1565c0;
        }
        
        .instructions {
            background-color: #fff3cd;
            border: 1px solid #ffeaa7;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        
        .instructions h3 {
            color: #856404;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .instructions h3 .icon {
            margin-right: 10px;
            font-size: 20px;
        }
        
        .instructions ul {
            color: #856404;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
        
        .instructions li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        
        .footer {
            background-color: #2c3e50;
            color: white;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .footer h3 {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        
        .footer p {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #bdc3c7;
        }
        
        .footer a {
            color: #3498db;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        
        .footer a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        
        .social-links {
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        
        .social-links a {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 0 10px;
            color: #bdc3c7;
            font-size: 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        
        .social-links a:hover {
            color: white;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .email-container {
                margin: 0;
                box-shadow: none;
            }
            
            .content {
                padding: 20px 15px;
            }
            
            .ticket-details {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            
            .summary-row {
                font-size: 14px;
            }
            
            .summary-row.total {
                font-size: 16px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <span class="emoji">🎫</span>
            <h1>¡Compra Confirmada!</h1>
            <p>Tus entradas están listas</p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Content -->
        <div class="content">
            <!-- Greeting -->
            <div class="greeting">
                Hola {{buyerName}},
            </div>
            
            <!-- Success Message -->
            <div class="success-message">
                <span class="icon">✅</span>
                <h2>¡Pago procesado exitosamente!</h2>
                <p>Tu compra ha sido confirmada y tus entradas están listas para usar.</p>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Event Information -->
            <div class="event-info">
                <h3><span class="icon">🎭</span>{{eventName}}</h3>
                <div class="event-details">
                    <div class="event-detail">
                        <span class="icon">📅</span>
                        <span><strong>Fecha:</strong> {{formatDate eventDate}}</span>
                    </div>
                    {{#if eventStartTime}}
                    <div class="event-detail">
                        <span class="icon">🕐</span>
                        <span><strong>Hora:</strong> {{formatTime eventStartTime}}{{#if eventEndTime}} - {{formatTime eventEndTime}}{{/if}}</span>
                    </div>
                    {{/if}}
                    <div class="event-detail">
                        <span class="icon">📍</span>
                        <span><strong>Ubicación:</strong> {{eventLocation}}</span>
                    </div>
                    {{#if eventVenueName}}
                    <div class="event-detail">
                        <span class="icon">🏢</span>
                        <span><strong>Venue:</strong> {{eventVenueName}}</span>
                    </div>
                    {{/if}}
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Tickets Section -->
            <div class="tickets-section">
                <h3><span class="icon">🎫</span>Tus Entradas ({{totalTickets}})</h3>
                
                {{#each tickets}}
                <div class="ticket-card">
                    <div class="ticket-header">
                        <div class="ticket-code">{{code}}</div>
                        <div class="ticket-type">{{type}}</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ticket-details">
                        <div class="ticket-detail">
                            <strong>Precio:</strong> {{formatPrice price currency}}
                        </div>
                        <div class="ticket-detail">
                            <strong>Fecha de compra:</strong> {{formatDate purchaseDate}}
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="qr-section">
                        <img src="https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=200x200&data={{qrToken}}" alt="Código QR para {{code}}" style="width: 120px; height: 120px; border: 2px solid #dee2e6; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                        <div class="qr-instructions">
                            Presenta este código en la entrada del evento
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                {{/each}}
            </div>
            
            <!-- Purchase Summary -->
            <div class="summary">
                <h3>Resumen de Compra</h3>
                <div class="summary-row">
                    <span>Entradas ({{totalTickets}}):</span>
                    <span>{{formatPrice totalAmount currency}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="summary-row total">
                    <span>Total Pagado:</span>
                    <span>{{formatPrice totalAmount currency}}</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Instructions -->
            <div class="instructions">
                <h3><span class="icon">💡</span>Instrucciones Importantes</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Guarda este email:</strong> Contiene tus entradas digitales</li>
                    <li><strong>PDFs adjuntos:</strong> Cada entrada tiene su PDF individual para imprimir</li>
                    <li><strong>Llega temprano:</strong> Te recomendamos llegar 30 minutos antes del evento</li>
                    <li><strong>Presenta tu entrada:</strong> Muestra el código QR en tu móvil o imprime los PDFs adjuntos</li>
                    <li><strong>Documento de identidad:</strong> Puede ser requerido en la entrada</li>
                    <li><strong>No compartas:</strong> Cada código QR es único y personal</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <h3>{{companyName}}</h3>
            <p>Gracias por confiar en nosotros para tu experiencia de entretenimiento</p>
            <p>¿Necesitas ayuda? Contáctanos en <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a></p>
            <p>Visita nuestro sitio web: <a href="{{websiteUrl}}">{{websiteUrl}}</a></p>
            
            <div class="social-links">
                <a href="#" title="Facebook">📘</a>
                <a href="#" title="Twitter">🐦</a>
                <a href="#" title="Instagram">📷</a>
                <a href="#" title="LinkedIn">💼</a>
            </div>
            
            <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #95a5a6;">
                Este email fue enviado a {{buyerEmail}}<br>
                © {{companyName}} - Todos los derechos reservados
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>